ons object for [compress](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2#compressor-options), [mangle](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2#mangler-options), and [output](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2#beautifier-options) options.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/common/util.js","line":5,"text":"----------------------------------------------------------------------------","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/common/util.js","line":7,"text":"Creates a hash object. If a `properties` object is provided, its own enumerable properties are assigned to the created hash. @memberOf util @param {Object} [properties] The properties to assign to the hash. @returns {Object} Returns the new","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/common/util.js","line":25,"text":"This method throws any error it receives. @memberOf util @param {Object} [error] The error object.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-dist.js","line":40,"text":"----------------------------------------------------------------------------","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-dist.js","line":42,"text":"Creates browser builds of the FP converter and mappings at the `target` path. @private @param {string} target The output directory path.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-doc.js","line":22,"text":"Converts arranged argument `indexes` into a named argument string representation of their order. @private @param {number[]} indexes The arranged argument indexes. @returns {string} Returns the named argument string.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-doc.js","line":38,"text":"Converts `funcNames` into a chunked list string representation. @private @param {string[]} funcNames The function names. @returns {string} Returns the function list string.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-doc.js","line":65,"text":"----------------------------------------------------------------------------","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-doc.js","line":67,"text":"Creates the FP-Guide wiki at the `target` path. @private @param {string} target The output file path.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":46,"text":"Checks if `name` is a method alias. @private @param {string} name The name to check. @returns {boolean} Returns `true` if `name` is a method alias, else `false`.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":57,"text":"Checks if `name` is a category name. @private @param {string} name The name to check. @returns {boolean} Returns `true` if `name` is a category name, else `false`.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":68,"text":"Checks if `name` belongs to a method that's passed thru and not wrapped. @private @param {string} name The name to check. @returns {boolean} Returns `true` if `name` is of a pass thru method, else `false`.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":80,"text":"Gets metadata for `func`. @private @param {Function} func The function to query. @returns {*} Returns the metadata for `func`.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":105,"text":"----------------------------------------------------------------------------","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":107,"text":"Creates FP modules at the `target` path. @private @param {string} target The output directory path.","restatesNextLine":false,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":118,"text":"Glob existing lodash module paths.","restatesNextLine":true,"givesRationale":false},{"file":"lib/fp/build-modules.js","line":126,"text":"Add FP a